    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-21T04:10:13+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-21T04:10:13+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T17:40:13Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-20T17:40:13Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A weak high pressure system about the west coast will move across the state today. A trough of low pressure and cold front move into the west late this evening and cross the remainder of of South Australia on Sunday. Another cold front clips the southeast on Monday, followed by a high pressure system, which will then move across southern parts of the state on Tuesday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW003" description="Kangaroo Island" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers, most likely later tonight. The chance of a thunderstorm later tonight. Winds northerly 15 to 25 km/h turning northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h in the late afternoon. Daytime maximum temperatures in the mid to high 20s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 5:10pm, UV Index predicted to reach 11 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">High chance of showers, most likely in the morning. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning. Mostly sunny afternoon. Winds northerly 20 to 30 km/h turning westerly before dawn. Overnight temperatures falling to around 16 with daytime temperatures reaching the mid to high 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower in the morning and afternoon. Winds westerly 25 to 40 km/h turning southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h during the afternoon then decreasing to 15 to 25 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 13 with daytime temperatures reaching around 19.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-25T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-24T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Light winds becoming east to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 10 with daytime temperatures reaching around 19.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
